{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f0858f55139d45f9","name":"Bipod","source":{"id":"source:reference-f0858f55139d45f9","title":"Bipod","revision":16237,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:32Z","sha256":"718384f42c9399c7eeafb6dc6ea77981247432e4a49cf46a3df106ee70dc0483","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16237","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Bipod&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f0858f55139d45f9","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 100\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Point"}," Cost:"]}," 0\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Bipod is an attached two-legged stand that steadies the barrel of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Weapon"}," when ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aiming"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aiming"}," or using ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"},". Preparing a Bipod for use is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},", and you cannot prepare a Bipod unless you are either ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prone","referenceId":"reference:4d99dff1fb964110"}," or adjacent to low objects (or other waist- to chest-height ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"},") that are between you and your target. If you move, you cannot use the Bipod until you prepare it again.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Bipod counts as a mount for any weapon that requires it (such as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Repeating Blaster"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Repeating_Blaster","referenceId":"reference:485c08c7b8997444"}," or an ",{"tag":"a","children":["E-Web Repeating Blaster"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/E-Web_Repeating_Blaster","referenceId":"reference:3bac50ec8614d1fb"},"). For other weapons, a Bipod makes ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aiming"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aiming"}," easier. If you have already ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aimed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aimed"}," at or attacked a particular target, each subsequent ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," Action requires only a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},". (Under these circumstances, a character with the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Sniping Master"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sniping_Master"}]}," Talent can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," once per round.) This benefit is lost if you attack or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," at any other target.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Bipod adds 20% to the weight of the weapon (minimum 1 kilogram).\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
